title Vinyl: scrubbing the seek bar (the owner, 2026-11-13): a finger held on the bar at three quarters of a 4:04 track: the knob and the fill under it, the elapsed time the target's (03:03), the remaining time from it; the seek happens on the release (640x480: qa-640-scrub, 480x320 and 320x480: qa-scrub-small)
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SCRUB 0.75

wait 1200
shot 01-scrubbing
expect esc
expect text "03:03"
expect text "-1:01"
expect noquit
